// Suspicious History File Operations - Linux | T1552.003 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/linux/auditd/execve/lnx_auditd_susp_histfile_operations.yml
type:EXECVE AND (*.bash_history* OR *.zsh_history* OR *.zhistory* OR *.history* OR *.sh_history* OR *fish_history*)

